{"speciesId":532,"names":{"fr":"Charpenti","es":"Timburr","en":"Timburr","ja":"ドッコラー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il combat avec une poutre. Quand il en arrive à transporter de lourds madriers sans problème, l’évolution est proche."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It fights by swinging a piece of lumber around. It is close to evolving when it can handle the lumber without difficulty."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il porte toujours une poutre. Il apparaît sur les chantiers pour aider aux travaux."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"These Pokémon appear at building sites and help out with construction. They always carry squared logs."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Always carrying squared logs, they help out with construction. As they grow, they carry bigger logs."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Always carrying squared logs, they help out with construction. As they grow, they carry bigger logs."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il porte toujours une poutre. Il apparaît sur les chantiers pour aider aux travaux."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Siempre lleva vigas de madera. Normalmente ayuda en obras de construcción."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"These Pokémon appear at building sites and help out with construction. They always carry squared logs."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"いつも 角材を 抱えている。 建築 現場に 現れて 工事を 手伝う ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il porte toujours une poutre en bois et aime aider aux travaux. Il passe à un lourd madrier quand il grandit."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Siempre lleva una viga de madera y ayuda en las construcciones. Se busca una viga más grande cuando se hace más fuerte."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Always carrying squared logs, they help out with construction. As they grow, they carry bigger logs."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"常に 角材を 持ち歩き 土木工事を 手伝う。育つと 大きな 角材に 持ち替える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il porte toujours une poutre. Il apparaît sur les chantiers pour aider aux travaux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Siempre lleva vigas de madera. Normalmente ayuda en obras de construcción."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"These Pokémon appear at building sites and help out with construction. They always carry squared logs."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"いつも 角材を 抱えている。 建築 現場に 現れて 工事を 手伝う ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il porte toujours une poutre en bois et aime aider aux travaux. Il passe à un lourd madrier quand il grandit."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Siempre lleva una viga de madera y ayuda en las construcciones. Se busca una viga más grande cuando se hace más fuerte."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Always carrying squared logs, they help out with construction. As they grow, they carry bigger logs."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"常に 角材を 持ち歩き 土木工事を 手伝う。育つと 大きな 角材に 持ち替える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il aime donner un coup de main sur les chantiers. Lorsque le travail cesse à cause de la pluie, il brandit sa poutre de colère."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Le gusta ayudar en labores de construcción. Cuando la lluvia obliga a interrumpir las obras, blande con furia su viga de madera."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It loves helping out with construction projects. It loves it so much that if rain causes work to halt, it swings its log around and throws a tantrum."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"建築の 手伝いが 好き。 雨で 工事が 休みの 日は 角材を 振りまわし 暴れる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Lorsque Charpenti est capable de soulever une poutre faisant trois fois son poids, le jour de son évolution est proche."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando logra transportar una viga de madera que triplica su altura y peso, es señal de que va a evolucionar."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Timburr that have started carrying logs that are about three times their size are nearly ready to evolve."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"自分の ３倍くらいの 角材を 持つように なった ドッコラーは 進化の 日が 近い。"}],"varieties":[{"id":532,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"comet-punch","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[20,"level-up",24],[25,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"low-kick","learns":[[11,"level-up",12],[14,"level-up",12],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",12],[16,"level-up",12],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",12],[18,"level-up",12],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",4],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",4],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"counter","learns":[[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"strength","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-throw","learns":[[11,"level-up",16],[14,"level-up",16],[15,"level-up",16],[16,"level-up",16],[17,"level-up",16],[1